o a bowl then crack in an egg  add coconut milk and whisk into the  batter into well combined  sweeten with runny honey  now you're ready to fry add melted  butter to a hot pan place in heat  teaspoons of batter flip and cook until  golden for a lovely vibrant wake up sir  with sliced fresh mango and drew over  the gorgeous citrusy syrup sweet sticky  and utterly irresistible ready in under  20 minutes  the ultimate indulgent pancakes  [Music]
 

